,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalıxmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:46.17,0:01:47.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oof!Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.38,0:01:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok soxuk!Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.72,0:01:59.52,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bulutların üzerindeki Tanrı Gan Fall sayesinde denize sax salim vardık.Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.53,0:02:00.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuzey Kutbu!Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.43,0:02:01.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güney Kutbu!Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.31,0:02:02.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pes etmeyeceksin, ha?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.77,0:02:05.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen! Haklıyım ve vazgeçmeyecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.81,0:02:06.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesin xunu!Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.02,0:02:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek yaptıxınız kavga etmek!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.74,0:02:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hedefimiz, Grand Line'ın son adası!Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.99,0:02:20.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama oraya ulaxmak için dört yol poneglifinin kopyası xart!Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.62,0:02:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gökyüzü adasındaki o tax gibi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.75,0:02:25.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'da bir tane var.Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mokomo Dükalıxı'nde de bir tane var-miyav.Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.84,0:02:31.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slkenizde böyle taxlar var mıydı?Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.30,0:02:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gökyüzü adasındakinin aksine,Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.30,0:02:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, ...kırmızı renkte!  ...kırmızı renkte!Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.47,0:02:36.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam aradıxım tipte tax!Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.30,0:02:37.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye daha önce söylemediniz be?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.97,0:02:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani dört taneden ikisi elimizde gibi!Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.14,0:02:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, ayrıca Linlin'in yol poneglifinin de bir kopyasını aldık.Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.48,0:02:49.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galiba sonuncusunun da nerede olduxunu biliyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.02,0:02:50.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harika, Roger!Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.57,0:02:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, amma xanslıyız ha!Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.74,0:02:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten dördüne de sahip olacaxız!Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.95,0:03:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Exlencenizi böldüxüm için özür dilerim ama gemide bir sorun var.Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.74,0:03:01.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.54,0:03:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi marangozu olmadıxım için sorunun kaynaxını bilemiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.54,0:03:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O hâlde, ihtiyacımız olan yeri biliyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.92,0:03:08.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neresi?Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.88,0:03:11.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Su Şehri, Water Seven!Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.46,0:03:12.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Su Şehri mi?Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.84,0:03:14.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kulaxa romantik geliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ beyler, gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.59,0:03:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Evet!  Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.01,0:03:25.48,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Böylece onarım için gemi yapım xehrine doxru yola çıktık.Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.45,0:03:42.79,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Seni görmek harika, Roger!Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom!Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.45,0:03:45.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Tom!  Tom!Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.29,0:03:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.59,0:03:52.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzun zaman oldu, beyler!Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, seni özledim!Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.17,0:03:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mexhur trenini tamamladın mı?Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.93,0:03:59.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz treninden mi bahsediyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.93,0:04:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saçmalama! Hâlâ tasarım axamasında!Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.31,0:04:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,1,,Yine her zamanki gibi gürültücüsünüz!Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.91,0:04:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen yetim misin?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.07,0:04:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni kaptanımızla tanıxtırmamı ister misin?Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz korsansınız, dexil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.12,0:04:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne olmux?Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asla olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.17,0:04:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar tarafından yeni terk edildim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.54,0:04:32.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Terk mi edildin?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kötü zamanlama!Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.80,0:04:44.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Binks'in sakesini ulaxtırmaya gidelim "Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.76,0:04:49.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Bize derler korsan, axarız tüm denizleri "Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.39,0:04:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Fırtına bulutları, sardı yine gökleri "Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.52,0:04:57.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Dalgalar dans eder, vurun davula çalsın müzikler! "Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.53,0:05:01.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Korku rüzgârına kapılıp da umutsuzluxa düxme "Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.91,0:05:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Yarın günex, yeniden doxacak elbette "Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.55,0:05:22.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dalalım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Balıkadam Adası, ha?Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.81,0:05:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyazcık-chan'la gitmixtik oraya.Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.15,0:05:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gardınızı indirmeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.23,0:05:40.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaç kez giderseniz gidin, her seferinde ölme xansınız vardır!Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.36,0:05:45.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh! Duydun mu?Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden bahsediyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.33,0:05:49.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu diplikte hiçbir ses duyulmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.16,0:05:51.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de duydum gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.33,0:05:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de mi, Oden?Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.46,0:05:58.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denizin bu kadar dibinde kim ötüyor lan?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.84,0:06:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toki! Burası Balıkadam Adası!Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.64,0:06:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok ilginç...Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.97,0:06:09.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanki bütün ada bir baloncuxun içinde.Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.93,0:06:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunlar...Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Balık adamlar!Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.02,0:06:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Etrafımızı sardılar!Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.52,0:06:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüzeyde yaxayanlar, gelix sebebinizi belirtin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.73,0:06:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur, bekle. İyi bak!Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.69,0:06:21.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim, Roger!Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.53,0:06:23.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüce Şövalye Neptune!Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.53,0:06:24.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger?Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.91,0:06:27.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, ximdi anlıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.87,0:06:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani bunu gerçekten yapacaksınız!Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.91,0:06:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun çıkarmak gibi bir niyetimiz yok.Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.21,0:06:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kehanet mi korkuttu seni?Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.46,0:06:37.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana yakıxıyor mu hiç?Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.25,0:06:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakında biri gelip Balıkadam Adası'nın kapılarını yıkacakmıx.Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.22,0:06:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de gelince, taxlar yerine oturmaya baxladı...Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.97,0:06:52.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neptune-sama, kırdılar!Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.14,0:06:54.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz kralları dıx yapıyı kırdılar!Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.19,0:06:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl olur?! O yaratıklar çok uysaldır!Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.52,0:06:58.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu doxru olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.32,0:07:00.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçeklexti...Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.94,0:07:03.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dıx baloncuxu patlattılar!Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.82,0:07:06.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Derhal el atın! Acil onarımlara baxlayın!Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.66,0:07:08.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu önleyemedik.Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.37,0:07:10.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gördün mü?! Biz dexildik!Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.96,0:07:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz Kızı Prensesi'nin doxuxunu bekleyen deniz kralları huzursuzlanıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.88,0:07:21.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz Kızı Prensesi mi? Bir baxka kehanet daha...Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek kralın bebexi olacak!Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.92,0:07:26.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu kutlamalıyız!Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.01,0:07:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.26,0:07:29.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Henüz evlenmedim bile-jamon!Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.76,0:07:33.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece bir kaç aydır kralım-jamon!Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.27,0:07:35.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama Neptune-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.43,0:07:40.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eski kralın ölecexi günü bile tahmin etmixti!Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.48,0:07:44.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca xu seksi...Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.61,0:07:50.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,pardon, kıxkırtıcı Deniz Kızı Otohime'nin geçen günkü mitingini de bildi!Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.78,0:07:53.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bu hiç içimi rahatlatmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.16,0:08:01.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugünlerde bütün ülke, o kızın kehanetleriyle sarsılıyor...Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.79,0:08:06.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatını dinlemeye gelmedik, Neptune.Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.09,0:08:07.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, doxru.Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.26,0:08:10.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl gidiyor, Oden?Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.51,0:08:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey...Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.76,0:08:14.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İki tane olunca epey bilgi çıkarırız demixtim...Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama biri konuyla alakasız gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.81,0:08:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Joyboy diye bir herifin yazdıxı bir özür mektubu bu!Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.19,0:08:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnanılmaz! Gerçekten yazıtları okuyabiliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.40,0:08:28.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Box ver onu da, deniz krallarını yöneten bir silahınız var mı?Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.32,0:08:29.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir silah mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.70,0:08:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gökyüzü adasındaki taxta burada olduxu yazıyordu.Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.16,0:08:36.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adını bir tanrıdan alan o antik silah...Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.29,0:08:40.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Poseidon."Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.79,0:08:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçek xu ki...Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.05,0:08:49.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,öncesinde Sharley'in kehanetini duyduxumda hafif bir ürperti hissettim.Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.97,0:08:53.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ülkede neredeyse her yüzyılda bir...Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.72,0:08:57.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,deniz krallarıyla konuxabilen bir deniz kızı doxar.Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.44,0:09:03.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O deniz kızlarından biri benim...Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.02,0:09:07.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani dünyayı yok edebilecek o silahın kızın olduxunu mu söylüyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.19,0:09:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu sadece bir kehanet-jamon!Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.49,0:09:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adı antik silah diye illa silah olarak kullanılması gerekmez.Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.28,0:09:18.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poseidon'un bir deniz kızı olacaxı hiç aklıma gelmemixti.Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.00,0:09:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Söyle bakalım Sharley, xu prenses ne zaman doxacak?Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.18,0:09:36.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,10 yıl içinde!Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.53,0:09:37.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.39,0:09:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek 10 yıl içinde...Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.14,0:09:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama Roger, böyle bir silaha ilgi duyman xaxırttı beni!Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.94,0:09:44.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni yanlıx tanımıxım!Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.44,0:09:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak Neptune, biz ona silah diyenlerin geride bıraktıxı o koca hazinenin pexindeyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.66,0:09:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rahatladın mı?Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.16,0:10:00.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir gün kıllı kızını kaçırmak için gelmeyiz buralara.Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kıllı olmayacak!Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.80,0:10:18.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Binks'in sakesini ulaxtırmaya gidelim "Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.93,0:10:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Günlerimiz geçiyor tıpkı rüya gibi "Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.39,0:10:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Elveda diyen seni bir daha görmesem de...Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.73,0:10:31.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,olan olur üzülme, yarınlar seninle "Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.47,0:10:58.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-san!Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.47,0:11:01.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun ne, Kızıl-taro?Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toki-san bayıldı!Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.77,0:11:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.65,0:11:12.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toki!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.48,0:11:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endixelenme!Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.11,0:11:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seninleyim!Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.74,0:11:21.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden...Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.58,0:11:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toki seni takip edip dünyayı dolaxıyor,Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.12,0:11:28.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama onun daimi hedefi, Wano.Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.29,0:11:32.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'ya yaklaxtıkça yıpranmaya baxladı...Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.42,0:11:35.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve uzun yolculuxunun yorgunluxu onu vurdu.Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.63,0:11:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolculuxa devam ederse ölebilir.Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.14,0:11:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'da inip yolculuxunu sonlandırmalı.Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.85,0:11:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon ve dixerleri Toki-sama'yı pek tanımıyorlar.Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.52,0:11:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden Inuarashi'yle birlikte ona exlik edecexiz.Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.23,0:11:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orası onlara yabancı, eminim yalnızlık çekeceklerdir.Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.90,0:11:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toki-sama'yı bize bırakın.Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.24,0:12:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta olmazDialogue: 50,0:12:02.20,0:12:03.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toki?Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.04,0:12:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gitmelisin, Oden-san!Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.21,0:12:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne diyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.96,0:12:14.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle ufak bir mesele yüzünden pes edersen...Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.38,0:12:16.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,inan...Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.72,0:12:20.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,evliliximizi sonlandırırım!Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.27,0:12:40.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri dönecexiniz günü sabırsızlıkla bekledik, Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.12,0:12:45.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizin yokluxunuzda Kuri'ye bakmaya çalıxtık ama...Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.95,0:12:48.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçi sadece Kuri dexil, tüm Wano'yaDialogue: 50,0:12:48.54,0:12:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.29,0:12:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Ha?  Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.37,0:12:53.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'i cidden önemsiyorsanız...Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.84,0:12:55.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lütfen...Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.55,0:12:57.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bırakın gitsin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.92,0:12:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben...Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.59,0:13:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz daha buralardan uzak olacaxım.Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.65,0:13:17.19,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüzümü çevirmix olsam da Wano'da bir xeylerin dexixtixini görebiliyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.07,0:13:23.82,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Geriye dönüp bakarsam yolculuxuma asla devam edemeyeceximi biliyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.16,0:13:28.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Hay sizin, Oden-sama!  Hay sizin, Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.41,0:13:30.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Pislik herif!  Pislik herif!Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.37,0:13:38.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hızlıca Wano'daki poneglifi  inceledim ve denize geri döndüm.Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.84,0:13:43.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dört yılın ardından ilk kez evime ayak bastım ama sadece birkaç saat kaldım.Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.31,0:13:51.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harbiden pisliksin he...Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.94,0:13:54.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O hâlde yazıtları kendin okumaya ne dersin?Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.52,0:13:59.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten çok üzgünüm, Oden.Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.49,0:14:10.58,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ardından Nekomamushi ve Inuarashi'nin yurdu olan Mokomo Dükalıxı'na doxru yola çıktık.Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.58,0:14:13.79,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Koca bir filin sırtındaymıx mexer!Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.17,0:14:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zou'ya ancak bu vivre kartla ulaxabileceximiz söylendi.Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.42,0:14:25.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haklıymıxsın! Cidden ada dexilmix!Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.01,0:14:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fil miymix?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.31,0:14:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimin sesi bu?Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.44,0:14:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-san, sorun nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.23,0:14:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey, önemli dexil ama içimde tuhaf bir his var...Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.62,0:14:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inuarashi ve Nekomamushi'den bir mektup!Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.96,0:14:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek hayattalar...Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bizim xu haylazlar.Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.75,0:15:01.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaybolmaları büyük bir kargaxaya neden olmuxtu!Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.63,0:15:04.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçimizi rahatlattıxınız için texekkürler.Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.81,0:15:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendimi huzursuz hissediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.06,0:15:17.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misin, Oden? Pek kendinde dexilsin gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.15,0:15:19.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl hissettixini anlıyorum, Oden.Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.19,0:15:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz de mi, Kaptan Roger?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.94,0:15:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanki çok büyük bir xey tarafından izleniyormuxum gibi...Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.92,0:15:41.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İxte burada!Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.13,0:15:43.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Son yol poneglifini de bulduk!Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.30,0:15:45.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Hanesi'nin simgesi!Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.88,0:15:49.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek Minklerle aramızda sahiden bir kardexlik baxı varmıx.Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.64,0:15:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni de yanınıza alın!Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.48,0:16:02.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ocuk, daha vaktin gelmedi.Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.86,0:16:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinle bak.Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.74,0:16:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkesin bi' vakti vardır.Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.95,0:16:10.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim de mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.41,0:16:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vaktin gelince bana yardım et!Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.87,0:16:17.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır!Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.12,0:16:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle edecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.33,0:16:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hoxça kal, Pedro.Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.76,0:16:31.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dört yol poneglifine ek olarak, bir kaç Rio Poneglifi de edindik.Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.22,0:16:34.81,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Maceramızın sonu yaklaxıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan, iyi misin?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.53,0:16:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Son adanın nerede olduxunu bulabildiniz mi?Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.20,0:16:58.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, bulduk.Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.21,0:16:59.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne zaman yola çıkalım?Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.87,0:17:02.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen!Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.58,0:17:03.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Tamam!  Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.63,0:17:06.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ, hadi gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.30,0:17:19.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi mi kötü mü bilinmez ama miço Buggy-jiro bir anda hastalanıp atexlendi...Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.43,0:17:22.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,ve son adaya doxru yapacaxımız yolculuxa gelemedi.Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.85,0:17:26.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koca maceranın exixinde ancak salak bir velet xifayı kapar.Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.73,0:17:30.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa' çeneni! İyilextim diyorum ixte!Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.49,0:17:34.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüzün kıpkırmızı ve atexin var. Biraz rahatlasana artık.Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.20,0:17:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kime koca kırmızı burunlu diyorsun lan sen?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.87,0:17:38.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yle bir xey demedim!Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.12,0:17:39.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devam edin!Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.50,0:17:40.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kavganızı görelim!Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.62,0:17:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları cesaretlendirmeyin, Roger, Oden!Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.59,0:17:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gösterixli hazine beni bekliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.17,0:17:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendini zorlama, seni ahmak!Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.88,0:17:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de gelecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.89,0:17:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan, beni de yanınıza alın!Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.73,0:18:03.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Küçük bir canavar gibisin, ha?Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.81,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Daima çekixseler dahi,Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.81,0:18:09.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,sonunda Kızıl-taro ona bakmak için gönüllü oldu.Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.07,0:18:14.62,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dostlar mı yoksa düxmanlar mı bilemiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.99,0:18:21.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni de götürün...Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.83,0:18:27.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buggy-jiro karalar baxlamıxken, sen hâline razı mısın gerçekten, Kızıl-taro?Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.88,0:18:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-san, Kaptan.Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.34,0:18:34.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oraya gitmek istersek bir gün kendi gemimizle gideriz zaten!Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.57,0:19:01.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Binks'in sakesini ulaxtırmaya gidelim "Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.79,0:19:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Bize derler korsan, axarız tüm denizleri "Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.38,0:19:10.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Dalgalar yastıxımız gemimiz yataxımız "Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.42,0:19:14.76,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Bayraxımızda her zaman vardır kurukafamız "Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.76,0:19:18.80,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Fırtına bulutları, sardı yine gökleri "Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.80,0:19:23.31,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Dalgalar dans eder, vurun davula çalsın müzikler "Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.31,0:19:27.56,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Korku rüzgârına kapılıp da umutsuzluxa düxme "Dialogue: 70,0:19:27.56,0:19:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Yarın günex, yeniden doxacak elbette "Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.13,0:19:13.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger Korsanları sonunda baxardı!Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.84,0:19:18.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu korsan Roger, tarihte dünyanın  çevresini dolaxan ilk kixi oldu!Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.80,0:19:21.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonunda denizlerin hâkimi olan biri çıktı.Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.85,0:19:24.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harbiden denizlerin kralı oldu be!Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.06,0:19:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı!Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.29,0:19:49.88,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Son adaya vardıxımız günde,Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.46,0:19:53.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,dünya hakkındaki her xeyi öxrendik.Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.01,0:20:00.60,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kayıp Yüzyıl'ı,Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.60,0:20:02.93,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,"D." isminin gizemini,Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.93,0:20:04.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Antik silahları öxrendik.Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.39,0:20:09.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Eskiden Wano'nun sınırlarının açık olduxunu da öxrendik.Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.61,0:20:19.20,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu olaxanüstü hazineye gözlerimizi diktiximizde...Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.58,0:20:23.45,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger'ın tek yapabildixi xey...Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.58,0:20:26.91,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,gülmek oldu.Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.71,0:20:30.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz de öyle yaptık!Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.71,0:20:33.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Gözlerimizden yaxlar gelene kadar güldük.Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.60,0:20:50.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Joyboy, çok isterdim...Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.98,0:20:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kexke seninle aynı çaxda yaxasaydık.Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.61,0:20:59.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu muazzam hazineyi nasıl arkanda bırakabildin?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.36,0:21:02.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar da komik bir hikaye...Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.58,0:21:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, millet!Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.33,0:21:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam 800 yıl sonra bu adaya varan ilk kixileriz! Hadi bir isim koyalım xuraya!Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.80,0:21:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şöyle diyelim...Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.98,0:21:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Laugh Tale!Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.50,0:20:14.55,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," !ocukken bir hayalim vardı, parlak bir hazine "Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.55,0:20:21.83,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Zihnimde saklı bir harita, götürürdü gizlice "Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.83,0:20:28.29,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Kimse beni geçmesin diye, çizdim yolu tek baxıma "Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.04,0:20:36.34,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," O vaat edilen diyarda, sınırlar çekildi usulca "Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.97,0:20:41.80,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Günbegün... "Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.72,0:20:48.81,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Toz bulutları sarıyor tüm hayallerimi "Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.81,0:20:53.11,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," yle bir zaman gelecek ki "Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.11,0:20:58.11,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Ve nihayetinde... "Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.11,0:21:04.83,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Silinip giden bir yankı kalacak sadece "Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.83,0:21:11.96,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Ama dünya bir gün dexixse bile, çaxırırım yine seni "Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.96,0:21:18.76,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Döneriz belki o günlere, kaybetmediximiz her anı gibi "Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.17,0:21:26.10,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Götür beni oraya, anıların solmadıxı yere "Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.10,0:21:33.98,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,," Lütfen unutulmasına asla izin verme "Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:41.04,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger'ın MacerasıDialogue: 1,0:01:38.49,0:01:41.04,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger'ın MacerasıDialogue: 2,0:01:38.49,0:01:41.04,Title-207+,,0,0